= The Crowds

The plazas around the Senate are full, day and night, of people holding the Chancellor's portrait. They sing. They cheer every senator who praises him and jeer every one who does not, and the HoloNet broadcasts both. Senators who were ready to sign the Caucus's petition find reasons to wait.
